{"num":344,"id":"2021-058","year":"2021","num0":"058","stars":3,"univ":"교토대학교","track":"이과","subj":"미적분","text":"π 곡선 y = log(1 + cos x)의 0 ≤ x ≤ 인 부분의 길이를 구하여라. 2  62","qimg":["p/jp/2021-058-q0.webp"],"simg":["p/jp/2021-058-s0.webp"],"ja":[{"p":"曲線 $y=\\log(1+\\cos x)$ の $0\\le x\\le\\dfrac\\pi2$ の部分の長さを求めよ。"}],"sim":{"ja":[{"p":"曲線 $y=\\log(\\cos x)$ の $0\\le x\\le\\dfrac\\pi3$ の部分の長さを求めよ。"}],"ans":{"ja":"$\\log(2+\\sqrt3)$"},"sol":{"ja":[{"p":"$y'=-\\tan x$ なので $\\sqrt{1+y'^2}=\\dfrac1{\\cos x}$ ($0\\le x\\le\\frac\\pi3$)。"},{"p":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\frac{dx}{\\cos x}=\\Big[\\log\\left(\\frac1{\\cos x}+\\tan x\\right)\\Big]_0^{\\pi/3}=\\log(2+\\sqrt3)$。"}]}},"art":""}